35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The stopwatch shows forty-seven minutes for the kitchen alone. Plus, two of us are away most months. That’s a lot of hours.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the kitchen watch confirms it. Two or three people cook, but everyone cleans. That’s the imbalance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
