40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, reminders are a symptom. The symptom is that the work isn’t distributed by usage.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, agreed. If we don’t fix the usage-to-work ratio, any rota will fail.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
