43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, hiring someone costs 4,200 yen an hour. That’s more than our spray budget.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shizue, the previous tenants’ note says they divided rooms permanently and stopped speaking. We must avoid that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, permanent division sounds like a trap. I need a system that accounts for absences.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, a fixed rota ignores the fact that some of us are rarely here.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, so what do we do? I don’t want to guess if the bathroom is clean!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
